          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: அஸ்திவாரம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அஸ்திவாரம் — astivāram — \"a foundation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அஸ்திவாரம் பலமாக இல்லாவிட்டால் வீடு நிற்காது. astivāram palamāka illāviṭṭāl vīṭu niṟkātu. If the foundation is not strong, the house will not stand."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also of ideas: நம்பிக்கைதான் உறவின் அஸ்திவாரம் (astivāram), trust is the foundation of a relationship."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of அஸ்திவாரம் (astivāram) is not settled: no dictionary we can check gives its source."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
