          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "செங்கல் (ceṅkal) is a native compound: செம் (cem), \"red\" (DEDR 1931), and கல் (kal), \"a stone\" (DEDR 1298): a red stone."
            }
          ]
        },
